Z||000000||FIEROCIOUS||07-27-2000||10:30 PM||||I was filling my car with gas today and as I was pumping a fire truck wizzed by I looked up for a second then continued pumping. I jumped into my car and proceded to drive down the road, when at a car dealer ship the fire truck had stopped. Can you guess why I'm posting this on the forum?<P>The car that the fire trucks attention was captured by was, you guessed it a Fiero a white coupe 84 or 85. I had only a glance (I hate rubberneckers) but I think they were roasting marshmellows!<P>One more bad Fiero impression for sure!<P>I love mine still though!||||reg||1
